# ============================================
# Application Secrets (MOST IMPORTANT)
# ============================================
# Only the files that actually hold a secret are ignored.
#
# application-dev.properties carries a real local database password and a
# development JWT key, so it stays out; application-dev.properties.example is
# tracked in its place. application.properties and application-prod.properties
# hold no literal secrets - prod reads every one of them from the environment -
# and ignoring them meant a fresh clone could not start the backend at all.
backend/src/main/resources/application-local.properties
backend/src/main/resources/application-dev.properties
backend/src/main/resources/application.properties.backup
application-dev.properties
application-local.properties

